  "rule": "Build `corpus/thesis-heldout` from the sealed held-out set of the thesis repository (amendment 24, part A).\n\nRule, fixed before any program of the set was read by PFC2:\n\n  R1  the line `#include \"spec.h\"` becomes `#include \"pfc.h\"`;\n  R2  a line including the program's own header (`#include \"kernel.h\"`) is removed;\n  R3  nothing else is re-spelled: the older clause spellings (REQUIRES, ...) are read by pfc.h;\n  R4  every line that is an `INVARIANT(...)` clause is removed: the experiment asks who supplies them.\n\nNothing is excluded. The canary comment of each kernel is kept.",
